	<p class="none" dir="ltr" style="text-align: center;"><span style="color: #800080; font-size: 40px;"><strong>ACA 2017</strong></span></p>
<h1 class="none" dir="ltr" style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 28px; font-family: 'arial black', sans-serif;"><strong><span style="color: #000080;">23rd Conference on Applications of Computer Algebra </span></strong></span></h1>
<h1 class="none" dir="ltr" style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 28px; font-family: 'arial black', sans-serif;"><strong><span style="color: #000080;">Jerusalem, July 17-21, 2017 </span></strong></span></h1>
