</div></div><div class="vc_tta-panel" id="1490180284469-a7df2360-df38" data-vc-content=".vc_tta-panel-body"><div class="vc_tta-panel-heading"><h4 class="vc_tta-panel-title"><a href="sarah@cet.ac.il#1490180284469-a7df2360-df38" data-vc-accordion data-vc-container=".vc_tta-container"><span class="vc_tta-title-text">Participants</span></a></h4></div><div class="vc_tta-panel-body">
