</div></div><div class="vc_tta-panel" id="1476008662079-9e925b95-ab88" data-vc-content=".vc_tta-panel-body"><div class="vc_tta-panel-heading"><h4 class="vc_tta-panel-title"><a href="sarah@cet.ac.il#1476008662079-9e925b95-ab88" data-vc-accordion data-vc-container=".vc_tta-container"><span class="vc_tta-title-text">Program</span></a></h4></div><div class="vc_tta-panel-body">
	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element ">
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<p><span style="font-size: 22px;">The registration desk will be open on Monday, July  17th, from 9:30 am.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-size: 22px;">It will be manned also every day during the breaks.</span></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><span style="font-size: 22px;">Opening ceremony: Monday, July 17th, late morning.</span></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><span style="font-size: 22px;">Mr. Ofir Akunis, the Israeli Minister of Science, Technology and Space, has accepted our invitation to address the participants during the opening ceremony.</span></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><span style="font-size: 22px;">The scientific program, Monday to Friday (about 12:00 am)  is here. Please download it.</span></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><a href="http://www.jct.ac.il/sites/default/files/%D7%9B%D7%A0%D7%A1_1_ACA.pdf"><span style="font-size: 22px;"><strong>Monday</strong></span></a></p>
<p><img class="alignnone wp-image-389 size-full" src="../../../../../wp-content/uploads/2016/09/ע�%2599�%259E�%2595�%2593_ACA-3-2.jpg" alt="עימוד_ACA.ai" width="3783" height="2755" srcset="http://www.aca2017.jct.ac.il/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/עימוד_ACA-3-2.jpg 3783w, http://www.aca2017.jct.ac.il/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/עימוד_ACA-3-2-300x218.jpg 300w, http://www.aca2017.jct.ac.il/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/עימוד_ACA-3-2-768x559.jpg 768w, http://www.aca2017.jct.ac.il/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/עימוד_ACA-3-2-1024x746.jpg 1024w" sizes="(max-width: 3783px) 100vw, 3783px" /></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><a href="http://www.jct.ac.il/sites/default/files/%D7%9B%D7%A0%D7%A1_2_ACA.pdf"><span style="font-size: 22px;"><strong>Tuesday</strong></span></a></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><img class="alignnone wp-image-408 size-full" src="../../../../../wp-content/uploads/2016/09/�%259Bנס_ACA.jpg" alt="כנס_ACA" width="2953" height="2236" srcset="http://www.aca2017.jct.ac.il/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/כנס_ACA.jpg 2953w, http://www.aca2017.jct.ac.il/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/כנס_ACA-300x227.jpg 300w, http://www.aca2017.jct.ac.il/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/כנס_ACA-768x582.jpg 768w, http://www.aca2017.jct.ac.il/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/כנס_ACA-1024x775.jpg 1024w" sizes="(max-width: 2953px) 100vw, 2953px" /></p>
<p><a href="http://www.jct.ac.il/sites/default/files/%D7%9B%D7%A0%D7%A1_3_ACA.pdf"><span style="font-size: 22px;"><strong>Wednesday</strong></span></a></p>
<p><img class="alignnone wp-image-392 size-full" src="../../../../../wp-content/uploads/2016/09/ע�%2599�%259E�%2595�%2593_ACA-5-1.jpg" alt="עימוד_ACA.ai" width="3783" height="2755" srcset="http://www.aca2017.jct.ac.il/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/עימוד_ACA-5-1.jpg 3783w, http://www.aca2017.jct.ac.il/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/עימוד_ACA-5-1-300x218.jpg 300w, http://www.aca2017.jct.ac.il/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/עימוד_ACA-5-1-768x559.jpg 768w, http://www.aca2017.jct.ac.il/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/עימוד_ACA-5-1-1024x746.jpg 1024w" sizes="(max-width: 3783px) 100vw, 3783px" /></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><a href="http://www.jct.ac.il/sites/default/files/%D7%9B%D7%A0%D7%A1_4_ACA.pdf"><span style="font-size: 22px;"><strong>Thursday</strong></span></a></p>
<p><img class="alignnone wp-image-393 size-full" src="../../../../../wp-content/uploads/2016/09/ע�%2599�%259E�%2595�%2593_ACA-6-1.jpg" alt="עימוד_ACA.ai" width="3783" height="2755" srcset="http://www.aca2017.jct.ac.il/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/עימוד_ACA-6-1.jpg 3783w, http://www.aca2017.jct.ac.il/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/עימוד_ACA-6-1-300x218.jpg 300w, http://www.aca2017.jct.ac.il/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/עימוד_ACA-6-1-768x559.jpg 768w, http://www.aca2017.jct.ac.il/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/עימוד_ACA-6-1-1024x746.jpg 1024w" sizes="(max-width: 3783px) 100vw, 3783px" /></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><a href="http://www.jct.ac.il/sites/default/files/%D7%9B%D7%A0%D7%A1_5_ACA.pdf"><span style="font-size: 22px;"><strong>Friday</strong></span></a></p>
<p><img class="alignnone wp-image-394 size-full" src="../../../../../wp-content/uploads/2016/09/ע�%2599�%259E�%2595�%2593_ACA-7-1.jpg" alt="עימוד_ACA.ai" width="3783" height="2755" srcset="http://www.aca2017.jct.ac.il/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/עימוד_ACA-7-1.jpg 3783w, http://www.aca2017.jct.ac.il/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/עימוד_ACA-7-1-300x218.jpg 300w, http://www.aca2017.jct.ac.il/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/עימוד_ACA-7-1-768x559.jpg 768w, http://www.aca2017.jct.ac.il/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/עימוד_ACA-7-1-1024x746.jpg 1024w" sizes="(max-width: 3783px) 100vw, 3783px" /></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><span style="font-size: 22px;">The book of abstracts id downloadable <a href="http://homedir.jct.ac.il/~naiman/aca2017/abstracts.pdf">here</a> (pdf file).</span></p>
<p><span style="font-size: 18px;"> </span></p>

		</div>
	</div>
</div></div><div class="vc_tta-panel" id="1476008662745-a3a2b726-8a5a" data-vc-content=".vc_tta-panel-body"><div class="vc_tta-panel-heading"><h4 class="vc_tta-panel-title"><a href="sarah@cet.ac.il#1476008662745-a3a2b726-8a5a" data-vc-accordion data-vc-container=".vc_tta-container"><span class="vc_tta-title-text">Important Dates</span></a></h4></div><div class="vc_tta-panel-body">
	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element ">
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<h4><strong>Submission of session proposals:</strong></h4>
<h4>March 1<sup>st</sup>, 2017: deadline for submission</h4>
<h4>March 31<sup>st</sup>, 2017 : notification of acceptance</h4>
<h4>Early submission is encouraged, and early notification of acceptance will follow.</h4>
<h4></h4>
<h4><strong>Submission of talks :</strong></h4>
<h4>April 30<sup>th</sup>, 2017: deadline for submission of talks / <span style="color: #ff0000;">extended to May 26th</span></h4>
<h4>May 31<sup>st</sup>, 2017 : notification of acceptance</h4>
<h4>Early submission is encouraged, and early notification of acceptance will follow.</h4>
<h4><strong>Final version of abstracts :</strong> June 25<sup>th</sup>, 2017</h4>

		</div>
	</div>
</div></div><div class="vc_tta-panel" id="1476008663700-dda11e18-8218" data-vc-content=".vc_tta-panel-body"><div class="vc_tta-panel-heading"><h4 class="vc_tta-panel-title"><a href="sarah@cet.ac.il#1476008663700-dda11e18-8218" data-vc-accordion data-vc-container=".vc_tta-container"><span class="vc_tta-title-text">Call for Sessions</span></a></h4></div><div class="vc_tta-panel-body">
	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element ">
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<h4 dir="ltr">The 23nd International Conference on Applications of Computer Algebra (ACA, <a href="http://math.unm.edu/~aca">http://math.unm.edu/~aca</a>) will take place in Jerusalem (Israel) on July 17-21, 2017. The ACA conferences are organized as a series of Special Sessions. All interested researchers can propose a Special Session by sending an e-mail to the Program Chairs by March 15st, 2017. The Scientific Committee (i.e. the ACA Working Group) will then decide on the acceptance of the proposed session. Accepted sessions will be immediately announced on the this site</h4>
<h4 dir="ltr">A proposal for a Special Session has to include:</h4>
<h4 dir="ltr">• title of the Special Session,</h4>
<h4 dir="ltr">• short abstract describing the Special Session,</h4>
<h4 dir="ltr">• contact information of the organizers.</h4>
<h4 dir="ltr">For more details see &gt;&gt; <a href="http://math.unm.edu/ACA/Organizing/special_session.html">http://math.unm.edu/ACA/Organizing/special_session.html</a></h4>
<h4 dir="ltr">Talk submissions have to be directed to the organizers of an appropriate Special Session. It is expected that organizers actively contact potential speakers.</h4>

		</div>
	</div>
</div></div><div class="vc_tta-panel" id="1476008664428-5645e1eb-7a74" data-vc-content=".vc_tta-panel-body"><div class="vc_tta-panel-heading"><h4 class="vc_tta-panel-title"><a href="sarah@cet.ac.il#1476008664428-5645e1eb-7a74" data-vc-accordion data-vc-container=".vc_tta-container"><span class="vc_tta-title-text">Call for Posters</span></a></h4></div><div class="vc_tta-panel-body">
	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element ">
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<h4>The poster session offers all participants the opportunity to present their research in an informal environment. Software demonstrations are also welcome.</h4>
<h4>A Mathematica license will be granted to the best poster or presentation.</h4>
<h4>Please see <a href="../../../../../index.html?p=189">the poster session page</a>.</h4>

		</div>
	</div>
</div></div><div class="vc_tta-panel" id="1476008683127-83efd121-90ae" data-vc-content=".vc_tta-panel-body"><div class="vc_tta-panel-heading"><h4 class="vc_tta-panel-title"><a href="sarah@cet.ac.il#1476008683127-83efd121-90ae" data-vc-accordion data-vc-container=".vc_tta-container"><span class="vc_tta-title-text">Sessions</span></a></h4></div><div class="vc_tta-panel-body">
	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element ">
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<div>
<article id="fl-post-5">
<div data-post-id="5">
<div data-node="57ebc7eba8b41">
<div data-node="57ebc7eba979e">
<p>List of accepted sessions:</p>
<ol>
<li><a href="http://math.unm.edu/%7Eaca/ACA/2017/education.html">Computer Algebra in Education</a></li>
<li><a href="https://munkres.us.es/wiki/pages/i5i8Q3b1/ACA_2017_Special_Session_ACATACA2017_Applied_and_Computational_Algebraic_Topology_.html">Applied and Computational Algebraic Topology</a></li>
<li><a href="http://compalg.jinr.ru/ACA2017_Special_Session/">Computer differential and difference algebra and its applications</a></li>
<li><a href="http://www.wzim.sggw.pl/2016/11/19/aca-2017-jerusalem-israel-july-17th-21st/">Computer algebra modeling in science and engineering</a></li>
<li><a href="../../../../../wp-content/uploads/2016/09/ACA-2017-computational-alg-geom-cryptography.pdf">Computational Algebraic Geometry, and Post-Quantum Cryptography - Multivariate Public Key Cryptography</a>Submit your abstract for this session <a href="https://easychair.org/conferences/?conf=aca2017pqc">here</a></li>
<li><a href="http://www.jct.ac.il/en/computer-algebra-applied-physics">Computer Algebra for Applied Physics</a></li>
<li><a href="http://theory.sinp.msu.ru/%7Eedneral/ACA2017/ACA2017DS.htm">Computer Algebra for Dynamical Systems and Celestial  Mechanics</a></li>
<li><a href="http://www.koutschan.de/conf/ACA17/">Algorithmic Combinatorics</a></li>
<li><a href="http://serwisy.umcs.lublin.pl/mozgawa">Geometry of Plane Curves</a></li>
<li><a href="https://sites.google.com/site/kovzol/aca2017-atpdg" target="_blank">Automated Theorem Proving in Dynamic Geometry</a></li>
<li><a href="http://www.cs.technion.ac.il/~gershon/ACAGeometricModeling.html" target="_blank">Algebraic methods in geometric modeling</a></li>
<li><a href="http://www-math.ias.tokushima-u.ac.jp/~nabesima/aca17/paraACA2017.html" target="_blank">Parametric polynomial systems</a></li>
<li><a href="../../../../../index.html?p=230" target="_blank">Computer Algebra in image processing</a></li>
<li><a href="http://www.math.tu-dresden.de/~reichard/aca2017/" target="_blank">Computer Algebra in Algebraic Graph Theory</a></li>
<li><a href="http://www.csd.uwo.ca/~moreno/HPCA-ACA-2017/hpca_2017_abstract.htm">High-performance Computer Algebra</a></li>
<li><a href="http://math.unm.edu/%7Eaca/ACA/2017/general.html">General session</a></li>
</ol>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</article>
</div>

		</div>
	</div>
</div></div><div class="vc_tta-panel" id="1476008683923-2aec7b63-812c" data-vc-content=".vc_tta-panel-body"><div class="vc_tta-panel-heading"><h4 class="vc_tta-panel-title"><a href="sarah@cet.ac.il#1476008683923-2aec7b63-812c" data-vc-accordion data-vc-container=".vc_tta-container"><span class="vc_tta-title-text">Registration</span></a></h4></div><div class="vc_tta-panel-body">
